msgstr "Fullständighet: {summary}"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:76
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{count} to fix"
msgstr "{count} att åtgärda"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:77
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{count} tips"
msgstr "{count} tips"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:78
msgid "The completeness check could not be run."
msgstr "Fullständighetskontrollen kunde inte köras."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:79
msgid ""
"The completeness check could not be run. Try again or contact an "
"administrator."
msgstr ""
"Fullständighetskontrollen kunde inte köras. Försök igen eller kontakta en"
" administratör."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:80
#, python-brace-format
msgid "This address forwards to {address}."
msgstr "Den här adressen skickas vidare till {address}."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:81
#, python-brace-format
msgid "This address also works over https: {address}"
msgstr "Den här adressen fungerar också över https: {address}"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:82
msgid ""
"The quality check of the European data portal only counts links that "
"answer directly, so the address it forwards to is the safer choice."
msgstr ""
"Europeiska dataportalens kvalitetsmätning räknar bara länkar som svarar "
"direkt, så adressen den skickas vidare till är det säkrare valet."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:83
msgid ""
"Plain http is not secure, and the link may stop working when the site "
"only allows https. https also avoids a forward, which the quality check "
"of the European data portal does not count."
msgstr ""
"Vanlig http är inte säker, och länken kan sluta fungera när webbplatsen "
"bara tillåter https. Med https slipper du också en vidarebefordran, som "
"Europeiska dataportalens kvalitetsmätning inte räknar."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:84
msgid "What changes:"
msgstr "Vad som ändras:"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:85
msgid "http becomes https"
msgstr "http blir https"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:86
msgid "a slash is added at the end"
msgstr "ett snedstreck läggs till i slutet"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:87
msgid "the slash at the end is removed"
msgstr "snedstrecket i slutet tas bort"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:88
msgid "www is added"
msgstr "www läggs till"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:89
msgid "www is removed"
msgstr "www tas bort"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:90
msgid "the address leads to another place, so check that it is the right page"
msgstr "adressen leder till ett annat ställe, så kontrollera att det är rätt sida"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:91
msgid "Use this address"
msgstr "Använd den här adressen"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:92
msgid "The address in the form has been changed. Check it before you save."
msgstr "Adressen i formuläret är ändrad. Kontrollera den innan du sparar."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:93
msgid "Reading the landing page… the review starts when it is done."
msgstr "Läser landningssidan… granskningen startar när den är klar."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:94
msgid "AI is reading the landing page…"
msgstr "AI läser landningssidan…"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:95
msgid "AI is reviewing the metadata…"
msgstr "AI granskar metadata…"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:96
msgid "AI is generating suggestions…"
msgstr "AI genererar förslag…"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:97
msgid "AI is reviewing title, description, keywords and theme…"
msgstr "AI granskar titel, beskrivning, nyckelord och tema…"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:98
msgid "The AI review could not be completed."
msgstr "AI-granskningen kunde inte genomföras."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:99
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The AI review could not be completed: {error}"
msgstr "AI-granskningen kunde inte genomföras: {error}"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:101
msgid ""
"The AI review is complete. Read and assess the suggestions before you "
"change anything."
msgstr "AI-granskningen är klar. Läs och bedöm förslagen innan du ändrar något."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:102
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Landing page downloaded {age}."
msgstr "Landningssidan laddades ner {age}."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:103
msgid "Downloading the landing page…"
msgstr "Laddar ner landningssidan…"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:104
msgid ""
"The landing page is only read over https, and this address starts with "
"http://. Change it to the https address to let the AI read the page."
msgstr ""
"Landningssidan läses bara över https, och den här adressen börjar med "
"http://. Byt till https-adressen så kan AI:n läsa sidan."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:105
msgid "Use the https address and read the page"
msgstr "Använd https-adressen och läs sidan"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:106
msgid ""
"The landing page could not be downloaded. The AI uses only the texts in "
"the form."
msgstr ""
"Landningssidan gick inte att ladda ner. AI:n använder bara texterna i "
"formuläret."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:107
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The landing page was not used: {reason} The AI uses only the texts in the"
" form."
msgstr ""
"Landningssidan användes inte: {reason} AI:n använder bara texterna i "
"formuläret."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:108
msgid ""
"The landing page could not be read. The AI uses only the texts in the "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Landningssidan gick inte att läsa. AI:n använder bara texterna i "
"formuläret."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:109
msgid "Try again"
msgstr "Försök igen"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:110
msgid "No landing page address: the AI uses only the texts in the form."
msgstr "Ingen adress till landningssida: AI:n använder bara texterna i formuläret."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:111
msgid "AI is analysing…"
msgstr "AI analyserar…"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:112
msgid "AI suggestions are ready."
msgstr "AI-förslagen är klara."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:113
msgid "The AI analysis did not succeed."
msgstr "AI-analysen lyckades inte."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:114
msgid ""
"Read the suggestions and use the ones you want. Nothing is saved until "
"you save the dataset."
msgstr ""
"Läs förslagen och använd de du vill ha. Inget sparas förrän du sparar "
"datamängden."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:115
msgid "There is no landing page address in the form."
msgstr "Det finns ingen adress till landningssida i formuläret."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:116
msgid "Waiting for a free place…"
msgstr "Väntar på en ledig plats…"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:117
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Waiting in line: {count} before you…"
msgstr "I kö: {count} före dig…"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:118
msgid "The AI did not answer in time. Try again."
msgstr "AI:n svarade inte i tid. Försök igen."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:119
msgid "The connection was lost. Try again."
msgstr "Anslutningen bröts. Försök igen."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:120
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Suggestions prepared {time}. Press the button for new ones."
msgstr "Förslag förberedda {time}. Tryck på knappen för nya."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:129
msgid "Review metadata"
msgstr "Granska metadata"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:131
msgid ""
"Ask AI for clearer title, description, keywords and theme, or for "
"translations. Only these fields are sent to the AI service. No suggestion"
" is saved or used automatically – you review and approve each one."
msgstr ""
"Be AI om tydligare titel, beskrivning, nyckelord och tema, eller om "
"översättningar. Bara de fälten skickas till AI-tjänsten. Inget förslag "
"sparas eller används automatiskt – du granskar och godkänner varje "
"förslag."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:134
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "Så fungerar det"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:136
msgid "The completeness check runs by itself and uses no AI."
msgstr "Fullständighetskontrollen körs av sig själv och använder ingen AI."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:137
msgid ""
"AI suggestions: you press the button. If the dataset has a landing page "
"address, the page is downloaded first and read as a source of facts."
msgstr ""
"AI-förslag: du trycker på knappen. Om datamängden har en adress till "
"landningssida laddas sidan ner först och läses som faktakälla."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:138
msgid ""
"Each suggestion is shown next to the current value. You edit it, then use"
" it; it goes into the form and is saved only when you save the dataset."
msgstr ""
"Varje förslag visas bredvid det nuvarande värdet. Du redigerar det och "
"använder det; det hamnar i formuläret och sparas först när du sparar "
"datamängden."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:140
msgid "Read more about how the assistant works"
msgstr "Läs mer om hur assistenten fungerar"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:144
msgid "Get AI suggestions"
msgstr "Få AI-förslag"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:147
msgid ""
"Downloads the landing page anew, for when it has changed, and uses the "
"new version for new AI suggestions."
msgstr ""
"Laddar ner landningssidan på nytt, för när den har ändrats, och använder "
"den nya versionen för nya AI-förslag."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:148
msgid "Download the landing page again"
msgstr "Ladda ner landningssidan på nytt"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:152
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Translates title, description and keywords into {languages}. The "
"suggestions are reviewed before they are used."
msgstr ""
"Översätter titel, beskrivning och nyckelord till {languages}. Förslagen "
"granskas innan de används."

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:154
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Suggest {language}"
msgstr "Föreslå {language}"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:154
msgid "Suggest translations"
msgstr "Föreslå översättningar"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:169
msgid "Rule check"
msgstr "Regelkontroll"

#: ckanext/metadata_assistant/templates/metadata_assistant/snippets/review_panel.html:170
msgid ""
"The catalogue's rules, checked without AI against the form as it is now: "
"what is missing or needs looking at. It updates when you change a field "
"or use a suggestion."
msgstr ""
"Katalogens regler, kontrollerade utan AI mot formuläret som det ser ut "
"nu: vad som saknas eller behöver ses över. Den uppdateras när du ändrar "
"ett fält eller använder ett förslag."

